Package: ootop
Version: 0.1.0-1
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: openOODA-tools <ops@openooda.org>
Description: Sovereign real-time system monitor with systemd slice grouping
 A btop/top replacement written in pure openOODA, featuring
 negative-trust capability security, systemd slice resource aggregation,
 ASCII meters and emotional mascot moods, and an MCP stdio surface.
